WEBVTT

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:10.270
These were the first zero-type mechas that we developed: SkyKnight and FireBrand.

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:15.280
We needed to make countless sacrifices to develop
the generation prior to Luxon and Bradyon

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.530
Do they still work?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:22.290
Not sure. Though we do perform
regular maintenance on them.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.360
But why are these here at the Hawaii base?

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:31.130
Originally, they were here for research purposes, but now they're stored in this big repository.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.290
The development of the new-type mecha will be completed soon.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.820
These mechas will not fly again.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:42.790
These were Dr. Fermi's. It's sad that we're no longer using them, but...

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.670
Mayday! Mayday!

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:50.160
This is the transporter Yanagi, 5-7-2.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:53.990
Our left engine has been badly damaged!
Hawaii Base, requesting clearance for an emergency landing!

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:57.740
<i>Roger. You're cleared to land on runway 5. Firefighters, hurry up!</i>

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.000
What is that?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.730
It looks like a civilian ship.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:11.960
I hope it's gonna be alright.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:15.170
They haven't sounded the alarm. It should be fine.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:27.980
It's time.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.130
Wh-What was that?!

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:35.950
An explosion?

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.620
A-A Valiancer?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.010
Red Alert! Red Alert!

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:50.060
Enemy Valiancers are attacking the base!

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.090
Be advised, the enemy may have already infiltrated the base. All units...

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:57.290
They're all panicking. What a sight.

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:00.140
You should try to look a little concerned as well.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.480
Please don't have such high expectations of me.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.980
Well then, let's go hunting.

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.900
Spread your wings

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:20.530
See the light of hope in the sky you have yet to witness

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:23.820
And don't ever give in to the weight of sorrow

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:29.200
Echo unto eternity, "Unisonia"

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:38.460
That world you see before your eyes

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:44.050
I wonder what colors it is made of

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.510
The pain of loss isn't something

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.480
You want to get used to, and yet

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:56.440
Even on a night like this, the stars glisten

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:03.400
Like a tarnished coin spilling from the palm of your hand

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.240
Can't go back

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.660
Want to go home

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.990
The two of them back-to-back

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:12.040
Break through

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.790
Turning unfading emotions into a lasting bond

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.130
Like painting over a colorless world

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.840
Let this sympathy reach

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:29.100
Let's build the future that we envision

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.310
You'll see, we'll even change fate

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:37.100
Transcending time, "Unisonia"

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.080
Father!

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:45.820
Hmm?

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.620
It's your face.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:51.000
I drew it in class.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.570
The teacher said I did a good job.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:03:59.210
Is that so?

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.720
Good for you!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.680
Yes!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.720
Military school?

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.930
Yes. I've decided.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:15.060
I want to become a soldier to protect Zogilia and her people.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.940
Just like you.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:21.860
Mm-hmm.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:27.570
Hina.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.540
We'll be arriving soon.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.250
Yes.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.340
Let's go.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.090
What's the situation?

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:47.010
Please tell us what's going on in detail.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.220
As you've heard through the broadcast,

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.480
enemy mechas have infiltrated the base and are
currently destroying buildings in several areas.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.020
Only eight Valiancers have been identified.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.520
Tarjim, it's almost time.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.310
Darn it.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.360
I'm not done yet,
but I guess I have no choice.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.190
Two mechas are now airborne and the remaining six are still on the ground.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:07.450
Units near Maintenance Building
No. 10 have begun to return fire, but...

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.490
But what?

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.450
We don't know what the enemy's objective is.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:16.170
Don't you think it strange that they only brought
eight Valiancers to attack a base of this size?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:21.670
If we ask headquarters for support, they'll definitely say,
"Take down the enemies," or "Defend the base."

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.420
Well then, what are we supposed to do?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.880
Well...

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.430
Putting that matter aside, all of you should act on your own.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.570
Elvira-kun and Mayu-chan, hurry back to the ship.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.680
Yes, sir!
Yes, sir!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:38.420
Aoba-kun and Dio, since Maintenance Building No. 7
has been infiltrated, retrieve Luxon and Bradyon.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.560
Fromm-kun will be your support.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:41.690
Aye aye, sir.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.900
Well then, let's begin.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.660
We don't know where the enemy will be hiding.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:52.200
Watch your back if you don't want to die.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.120
Seriously?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.460
They left the hatch open.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:39.870
Makes things easier for me.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:45.050
How is it? Does it work?

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.880
Yes! No problem!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.720
It's gonna take some time, though.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.390
Do it as fast as possible!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.340
Understood!

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.010
How are things outside?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:57.720
If you mean the units engaged in battle,
they'll probably be able to hold their own for a while longer.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.680
Good.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:02.560
Once you've bypassed the mobile security, start withdrawing.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:03.860
Understood.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:11.070
I'll call them so you can tell them you're here.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:16.410
Because if I didn't, you would've ended up being our prisoner.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.540
I didn't want that to happen.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.340
Hina!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.680
Father?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:35.510
Lieutenant Commander!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.810
Father!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.480
They're on to us.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.650
They sure are trigger-happy in their own base!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:48.900
Hurry! In here!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:49.900
Father!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.360
I'm fine.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.120
Hina! Lieutenant Commander!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.120
Young lady, you treat his wounds.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.920
We'll meet up with another team
and secure an escape route.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:07.750
I understand.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.880
Now then...

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.050
We have to stop the bleeding immediately.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.260
Father?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:21.600
H-Hina, I have... something to tell...

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.940
Don't talk! Your bleeding will just get worse!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.560
Please, you have to listen to me.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.860
Hina...

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:37.320
You're... not really my daughter.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:38.620
What?

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:48.750
Aoba!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.370
I-I'm fine.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:52.010
We've been cut off, eh?

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:55.220
We're gonna proceed to the target location along this road.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:57.470
You'll have to find another route to get there.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.390
Don't die!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.180
Hey, wai—

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.230
What?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.400
It must've been a decade ago.

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:16.480
I was assigned to the bloodstained battlefield that was Zagreb.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:20.410
Amongst the burning rubble...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.870
I found you.

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:30.860
Your clothes were ragged, you couldn't talk properly,
and you had lost all your memories.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.930
The only thing you could remember was that your name was Hina.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:47.600
I took you in as an orphan of war and we became father and daughter.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.940
That can't be...

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.360
Even if you tell me that...

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:58.860
You don't believe me, huh?

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:04.660
Someone about to die wouldn't make up a story like that.

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:08.670
Hurry up!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.130
Don't let Zogilia do whatever they want anymore!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.460
Go, Hina.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:15.380
What?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.670
Get out of here before the enemy finds us.

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.580
Not without you!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:24.770
I'm done for. Leave me behind.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.270
No way!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.370
Hina.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.520
No!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.650
Hina!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:34.900
At least, let me show off as your father one last time.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:36.860
But...

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:38.860
But...

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:41.780
Go on, Hina.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.410
Father...

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.580
Go!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.690
That guy?

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:10.930
Is he dead?

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.980
Just in case, shoot him again.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.820
You guys sure are rude.

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:20.070
Just when I was reminiscing about my daughter.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:24.450
You can all go to hell with me.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.620
Another explosion?

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.710
Damn it.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.290
I'm just a high school student, after all.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.750
How can I shoot people just because
you told me to out of the blue?

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:39.670
Where am I anyway?

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.760
Father...

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:54.810
You're... not really my daughter.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:59.150
The only thing you could remember was that your name was Hina.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.230
I...

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.270
I...

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.660
Because you brought me here.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.790
As I said before, you were my classmate, Yumihara Hina!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:15.630
If that's the case, where did she go?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:25.430
Hina!

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:31.930
Hina, why are you here?

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:35.200
Don't tell me the enemies that attacked us were...

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:39.520
I'm... I'm not who I thought I was.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.320
Eh?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:44.570
Who am I?! Am I the Hina you know?!

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:47.490
Who...?

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.740
Hina...

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.210
The Lieutenant Commander?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.790
Yeah, after I had to leave him there.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:58.840
What about Hina?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.300
Not sure.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.010
It doesn't look like she was caught in the explosion.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.760
Hey, cover me!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:06.730
What?

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:08.680
Wait, where do you think you're going?!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.600
What about the operation?!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.970
All that's left is to launch the mechas on autopilot!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.520
I'm gonna look for Hina.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.100
H-Hey!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.240
I see. Lieutenant Commander Ryazan has...

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.080
Yes.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.040
Is it still possible to continue the operation?

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.790
There was a slight setback but it's still within the allowed range.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:41.170
Alright. Well then, I'll leave you in charge of things there.

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.920
We'll proceed on our end according to the plan.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.050
Yes, sir.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.010
Lieutenant Colonel.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.930
There's no problem.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:51.600
Please think of the plan's success as our top priority.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:58.480
I see...

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.270
So that's what happened.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.310
Yeah.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:06.970
Maybe I <i>am</i> the Hina you knew.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:11.740
In that case, it would kinda make
sense why I lost my memories.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.450
Although, I still don't understand the logic behind it.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.290
Hina...

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:22.170
What am I exactly? What am I?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.340
Come over here, Hina!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.300
What?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.180
Come with us, to the Cygnus!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.970
Wh-What are you saying?

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:33.630
It'll be fine!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:36.640
They accepted me, and I came from 70 years in the past.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.980
If you tell them your situation,
they'll understand even if you're the enemy.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:46.740
And there are many people you can rely on.
Even though that guy Dio can be somewhat intolerant.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:49.950
Anyway, it's gonna be fine! I'll bet on it!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.590
B-But I...

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:57.700
I don't even know who I am.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.960
You are who you are, right?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:05.750
I don't mind if you're the Hina of this era,
or my classmate from the past.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.130
You are you!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.880
You can accept everything that you are now. So...

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:11.720
What do you say?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.060
Thank you.

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:19.060
But...

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.600
Hina!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:21.940
Get away from that guy!

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:22.770
Bizon!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.270
Hurry!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:25.770
You are...

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.740
The pilot of that new-type mecha...?

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.410
Hina, you really are...

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.030
No, you're wrong!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.370
Then why are you protecting him?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.910
That guy is the enemy!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:37.700
That's...

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.040
Wait! Listen to what she says—

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:39.870
Shut up!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:44.670
Hina, aren't you a Zogilian soldier and my comrade?!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.340
We've fought together all this time.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:47.920
Why?!

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:49.340
I...

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:54.300
Lieutenant Commander Ryazan didn't die for your
sake just so you could turn around and do this!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.550
Are you betraying your father?!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:58.770
That...

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.590
Damn it.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.730
D-Damn it!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.950
Bizon!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:17.490
Aoba!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:19.870
Hina!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.580
Stop!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.790
But...!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.330
Fromm, take that idiot away!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.290
Yes, sir!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.590
Come on, hurry up and take cover!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.010
We'll talk later.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.090
We'll bypass their security soon.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:36.870
Our mission is to steal the Alliance's new-type Valiancer. You hear me?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.560
Okay.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:42.600
Let's go.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.310
Aoba!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:49.400
Aoba...

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.490
The ground battle has calmed down a bit.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.740
Let's fight the ones in the sky.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:01.750
Alright.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.580
We should make them pay for raiding our base.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:06.620
What?!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:07.670
The radar has detected something.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:08.960
Multiple heat sources.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.420
Cruise missiles!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.170
Activate the Nectar Curtain.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:15.930
Extend its range to protect the base from stray missiles.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:24.350
Man, what's happening?

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:27.440
They weren't planning to capture the base, but destroy it instead?

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.090
Dio! Aoba!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.410
About time you guys got here!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:56.300
No.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.300
The enemy is piloting them.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.550
They've been taken!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.350
What?!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.180
Captain!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:02.510
Hm...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.810
Shoot them down.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:06.430
Wha—?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:07.640
But...

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.230
Better than letting them fall into enemy hands.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.310
Please hold on!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:14.480
Hina's onboard! Shooting them down is...

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.940
That's enough!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.060
Don't you understand what is happening?!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:20.990
This isn't what Hina wants!

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:21.780
What?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.530
Hina is troubled now!

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.120
Her father died.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.540
She doesn't even know who she is.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.830
She's in no condition to do something like that!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.710
But, the Coupling mechas...

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:35.800
I can't shoot at her and I won't let anyone else shoot at her either!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.470
Aoba-san and Dio are...

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:47.390
Those are...

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.560
They can't use the Coupling System.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.980
Let's end this quickly!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:54.820
Got it!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:55.730
Stop!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:59.530
Those mechas are dangerous! Get back to the base!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.200
I'm sorry, Elvira-san.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.580
Transfer both mechas' Remote Access Priority here.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.040
We have to stop them from Coupling or else...

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:08.750
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:14.170
Understand? Our only objective is to get Luxon and Bradyon back!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.750
Yeah, I know.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:16.710
Let's do this!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.010
Connect with Dio!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.340
Accept!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.530
SkyKnight and FireBrand, Coupling succeeded!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:47.370
Impossible. With those settings, how could they successfully perform a Coupling?!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.390
Dammit!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:08.350
These cockpits are so different, they're hard to operate.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.430
Bizon, the enemy is coming!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.230
Dammit! Those bastards...

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.240
Hina, you're in there, aren't you?!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.110
This voice...

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.700
Stop it! If you stop now,
you can still make it!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.450
Aoba...

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.830
Stay away from Hina!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.710
Aoba!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.840
You bastard! You should die here!

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.920
Crap! Don't interfere!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.840
Let him go!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.260
You...!
You...!

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.850
Both of their Emphater Waveforms...!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:49.680
This is...

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.080
Bizon!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:21.590
What was that... just now?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:28.510
We've accomplished the planned objective and will begin retrieval.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:31.100
All units, move back to the rendezvous point.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.520
B-But...

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.850
Further fighting is not necessary.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.650
Let's go, Bizon.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:50.740
Damn it!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:55.500
Don't run, you assholes!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:08.590
Wh-What was that just now?

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:15.680
Aoba, you...

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:20.800
With my heart, I call out

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:25.180
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:29.690
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:34.320
Just for now, please

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:38.490
I know you

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:42.990
I'm searching for you

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:45.450
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:45.450 --> 00:22:52.080
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:52.080 --> 00:23:00.630
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:05.220
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:05.220 --> 00:23:09.770
and the times I have wondered

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:14.020
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:16.270
I want to save you,

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:18.360
I want to protect you

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:22.740
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:25.620
Wait for me

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.370
The love we'll surely find

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:35.170
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:40.180
Next episode, on Buddy Complex:

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:41.760
"The Bond Between Them."
